---
flowchart TD
  accTitle: Proposed OpenShieldAI defense architecture
  accDescr: Authorized inputs flow through evidence validation, bounded investigation and a typed proposal. Policy and exact human approval precede the future S3 action adapter. Independent verification determines outcomes. Denied proposals are revised; inconclusive checks return for evidence. This is a proposed design, not a live system.
  INPUT["AUTHORIZED INPUTS<br/>Enrolled assets · telemetry · backup metadata"]
  EVIDENCE["EVIDENCE + PROVENANCE<br/>Validate · sanitize · preserve source refs"]
  REASON["CONTINUOUS AI SUPERVISION<br/>Changed evidence · bounded investigation"]
  PROPOSAL["TYPED RESPONSE PROPOSAL<br/>Exact action · impact · preconditions"]
  GATE{"POLICY + HUMAN<br/>APPROVAL"}
  ACTION["SCOPED ACTION · S3 ONLY<br/>One allowlisted adapter · exact grant"]
  VERIFY["INDEPENDENT VERIFICATION<br/>Intended effect + service health"]
  OUTCOME["OUTCOME + RESIDUAL RISK<br/>Verified effects · gaps · next owner action"]
  INPUT --> EVIDENCE
  EVIDENCE --> REASON
  REASON --> PROPOSAL
  PROPOSAL --> GATE
  GATE -->|approved| ACTION
  GATE -.->|denied / revise| PROPOSAL
  ACTION --> VERIFY
  VERIFY -->|observed result| OUTCOME
  VERIFY -.->|inconclusive / more evidence| EVIDENCE
  classDef future fill:#0b1b16,stroke:#5b8070,stroke-dasharray:5 4,color:#c2d7ca
  class ACTION future
